  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITC 2013-2016 - ITC 2013-2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ITC 2013-2016.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Trade Centre - ITC - m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar   f&#xf6;r att sm&#xe5;f&#xf6;retag i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder ska &#xf6;ka sin export. ITC        efterstr&#xe4;var att ta fram h&#xe5;llbara och inkluderande                    utvecklingsl&#xf6;sningar till den privata sektorn, handelsinstitutioner   och beslutsfattare, som i sin tur ska leda till en &#xf6;kad handel. Sida  st&#xf6;djer ITCs programverksamhet. ITC &#xe4;r en FN/WTO organisation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Trade Centre -ITC- aim is to create the conditions  for small businesses in developing countries to increase their        exports. The ITC strives to achieve sustainable and inclusive         development solutions to the private sector, trade institutions and   decision makers, which should lead to an increase in trade. Sida      supports the ITC development programs. ITC is a joint UN/WTO agency.</narrative>
  </description>
